!*** Class 21 ROOH=RO+OH ***
!---------------------------
CCOC*OOCCOOH-2<=>CCOC*OOCCO-2+OH   1.000e+16 0.00 4.160e+04    !HN Sarathy et al. CF2011
CCOC*OOCCOOH-1<=>CCOC*OOCCO-1+OH   1.000e+16 0.00 4.160e+04    !HN Sarathy et al. CF2011

