CCOC*OOJ+CH3CHO=CCOC*OOCCO-2  1.00e+11  0.  11900.  !HN Sarathy et al. CF2011
CCOC*OOCJ+CH2O=CCOC*OOCCO-1   1.00e+11  0.  11900.  !HN Sarathy et al. CF2011

