CCOC*OOCJCOOH-2=>OH+CCOC*OO-COC   6.000E+11  0.00  2.200E+04  !HN 3-membered ring, Sarathy et al. CF2011
CCOC*OOCCJOOH-1=>OH+CCOC*OO-COC   6.000E+11  0.00  2.200E+04  !HN 3-membered ring, Sarathy et al. CF2011

