CCOC*OOCCJOOH-1 + O2 = DEC-OOH-12-O2 4.52E12  0.00  0.00 ! primary site, WJP: use primary rate, Sarathy et al. CF2011
CCJOC*OOCCOOH-2 + O2 => DEC-OOH-23-O2 1.41E13  0.00  0.00 ! alpha site, WJP: use tertiary rate, Sarathy et al. CF2011
DEC-OOH-23-O2 => CCJOC*OOCCOOH-2 + O2 7.76E20 -1.439 333400.0! Reduce Ea by 7.8 kcal
CCJOC*OOCCOOH-1 + O2 => DEC-OOH-13-O2 1.41E13  0.00  0.00 ! alpha site, WJP: use tertiary rate, Sarathy et al. CF2011
DEC-OOH-13-O2 => CCJOC*OOCCOOH-1 + O2 1.95E+20 -1.201 33370.0 ! Reduce Ea by 7.8 kcal
CJCOC*OOCCOOH-1 + O2 = DEC-OOH-14-O2 4.52E12  0.00  0.00 ! primary site, WJP: use primary rate, Sarathy et al. CF2011

