DEC-OOH-13-O2 = DEC-KET-13 + OH  1.23E09  0.00  19.21e3  !HN 8alpha, deg=1, Ea-1 Rate from H. Nakamura, CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ//MP2/6-311G(d,p)
